    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/event-band-services/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Event Band Services theme is designed for professionals such as DJs, live bands, and entertainment service providers who need a structured platform to present their work and services online. It includes sections for showcasing services, event schedules, playlists, music albums, galleries, past performances, upcoming shows, artist profiles, and client feedback. A music producer can use the integrated audio player to share tracks or sample mixes directly with visitors. The layout supports clear navigation and organized content display suitable for an event management company managing multiple events and performers. A dj can present performance details, share media, and provide booking information through dedicated sections. The theme is responsive and adapts to different screen sizes, ensuring usability across devices. It also includes WooCommerce compatibility for selling tickets, merchandise, or digital products, along with Contact Form 7 support for handling inquiries. A wedding planner can use the theme to highlight event portfolios and service offerings in a structured format. It also suits music producers who want to display their projects, collaborations, and audio content. The design supports general event management needs by offering flexible content sections and media integration. Another music producer can utilize the same framework to organize releases and showcase creative work efficiently."
    },
